    "Helix is a continuation of enzo by ParkerBritt, whose engine, node system and attribute model remain its foundation. Both are released under the MIT licence.\n\n3D files are read with Assimp (BSD 3-Clause, with Draco, Apache 2.0) and Model I/O.": {
